   33 Statement: ExprList SEMI
   34          | SEMI
   35          | LBRACE StatementList RBRACE
   36          | LBRACE RBRACE
   37          | IF LPAR ExprList RPAR StatementError ELSE StatementError
   38          | IF LPAR ExprList RPAR StatementError
   39          | WHILE LPAR ExprList RPAR StatementError
   40          | RETURN SEMI
   41          | RETURN ExprList SEMI
   42          | LBRACE error RBRACE

   43 StatementList: StatementList StatementError
   44              | StatementError

   45 Expr: Expr ASSIGN Expr
   46     | Expr PLUS Expr
   47     | Expr MINUS Expr
   48     | Expr MUL Expr
   49     | Expr DIV Expr
